<title>USA: Columbia/HCA Healthcare Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Columbia/HCA Healthcare Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Quarter</p>
<p>							  1997	   1996</p>
<p> Revenues					   $5,328	 $4,951</p>
<p> Operating income (A)			    1,263	  1,121</p>
<p> Net income					    479	    416</p>
<p> Earnings per share				 0.70	   0.61</p>
<p> Shares used (000)				679,705	678,048</p>
<p>		(Dollars in millions, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: (A) Income before depreciation and amortization, interest expense, minority interests and income taxes.  </p>
<p>Q1 1997 First Call analysts' consensus estimate $0.70.</p>
</text>
